      "text": "Nephites contend with Lamanites to defend their religion, Alma 43:47. Lamanites are angry with Nephites because of religion, Alma 44:2. God strengthens Nephites to gain power over Lamanites, by their faith, religion, Alma 44:5. those who will maintain title of liberty should covenant to maintain their rights, religion, Alma 46:20. Moroni1 has sworn oath to defend his religion, Alma 48:13. freemen covenant to maintain privileges of religion by free government, Alma 51:6.",
